<div class="w-full min-h-screen bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url(<%= image_path '1-phwoar-web-bg-only.jpg' %>)">
  <div class="bg-gray-300/80 min-h-screen">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4">
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 p-8">
        <%= image_tag '1-phwoar-web.jpg', class: 'max-h-96 sm:max-h-[28rem] md:max-h-[35rem] lg:max-h-[42rem] mx-auto' %>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 px-8 pb-8 md:p-8 text-center">
        <h1 class="font-chuck-five text-2xl mb-4">Mikey Clarke</h1>

        <h2 class="text-5xl mb-6">GET IT HERE</h2>
        
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <%= link_to asset_path('/assets/apocalypse-part-one-just-for-you-yeah-youre-fab.epub'), class: 'basis-1/4 hover:scale-[1.05] duration-150', target: '_blank' do %>
            <%= image_tag 'epub-logo.png' %>
          <% end %>

          <%= link_to asset_path('/assets/apocalypse-part-one-just-for-you-yeah-youre-fab.mobi'), class: 'basis-1/4 hover:scale-[1.05] duration-150', target: '_blank' do %>
            <%= image_tag 'mobi-logo.png' %>
          <% end %>

          <%= link_to asset_path('/assets/apocalypse-part-one-just-for-you-yeah-youre-fab.pdf'), class: 'basis-1/4 hover:scale-[1.05] duration-150', target: '_blank' do %>
            <%= image_tag 'pdf-logo.png' %>
          <% end %>

          <%= link_to asset_path('/assets/apocalypse-part-one-just-for-you-yeah-youre-fab.docx'), class: 'basis-1/4 hover:scale-[1.05] duration-150', target: '_blank' do %>
            <%= image_tag 'docx-logo.png' %>
          <% end %>
        </div>

        <p class="text-4xl mt-5 mb-5">Just want to start reading?</p>
        
        <p>Click 'ePUB', then follow any of:</p>
        
        <p><%= link_to 'Guide for Kindle', "https://kindlepreneur.com/epub-to-kindle/", class: 'underline' %></p>

        <p><%= link_to 'Guide for Apple Books', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xO-FGms2iVM', class: 'underline' %></p>

        <p><%= link_to 'Guide for Nook', 'https://help.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/5598405156891-NOOK-Reading-App-for-Windows-Importing-PDF-or-ePub-files', class: 'underline' %></p>

        <p><%= link_to 'Guide for Kobo', 'https://help.kobo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360024775093-Add-non-protected-PDF-and-ePub-files-to-your-Kobo-eReader-using-your-computer', class: 'underline' %></p>

        <p class="mt-5">Alternatively, if you're happy to faff around with any other file types like the seasoned badass you are, then by all means take your pick of any others. They're naff.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
